# NEVER PUBLISH THIS REPO TO NPM
#
# This is the SERVER side of /contract:
#   - libcontract/ (Zig core)
#   - zig/ (binary source)
#   - docs/ (observations-fractal-loop.md — design substrate)
#   - scripts/ (build, sign, sync — wallet operations)
#   - audit-gate/, bm25-gate/, ... (closed-source quality gates)
#
# The PUBLIC surface is `@aiko/contract` — a separate repo at
# ~/Projects/contract-thin-client/ — and ONLY that one gets published.
#
# This .npmignore is defensive belt-and-suspenders. The repo has no
# package.json so `npm publish` already errors. If a package.json ever
# lands here by accident, this file ensures nothing useful ships.
#
# Doctrine: OPEN-SOURCE-NOTICE.md split — capture/RE engine + backend
# + CLI binary + anti-bot research = CLOSED; SDKs + thin client = OPEN.

# Exclude EVERYTHING (whitelist nothing — we don't want anything
# from this tree to leave on npm)
*
.*
